  "details": "When we upload a world we can choose to allow players to jump or not, the height and walking speed and we could also allow players to fly or not and why not change its walking speed because in my opinion in some cases flying is not a bad thing, for example when doing an RP it was very useful for the RP administrators to be able to fly, he could have an overview of the RP move quickly, teleport , help players by transporting them to the right places. In conclusion I think leaving the choice to the creator of the world is a good idea because it does not distort the gameplay and it just adds more mobility.",
